  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Deendayal Somani S/O Banshilal Somani ... vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 9 August, 2024 1 Mc In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Binod Kumar Dwivedi On The 9 th Of August, 2024 Misc. Criminal Case No. 53269 of 2021 Deendayal Somani S/O Banshilal Somani Proprietor Of M/S Shri Nakodasales Versus The State Of Madhya Pradesh As per section 77 of the Act, the cognizance can be taken within a period of one year from the date of offence, however the Commissioner of Food Safety may for reasons to be recorded in writing approve prosecution within an extended period upto 3 years.",
    "facts": "The designated Officer has granted sanction on 7.12.2013 and complaint was filed before the trial court on 18.11.2014.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
